            "line": 1142,
            "text": "theorem background_eq_shaped_profile {q r : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (hr : 0 < r)\n    (lam U B η : ℝ) :\n    background lam (shapedAmplitude B η * (2 : ℝ) ^ (1 / 2 + lam)) (Real.sqrt q) U r =\n      U * shapedAmplitude B η * (r ^ 2 / (2 * q)) ^ (-(1 / 2 + lam))"
